  ('mth-121-calculus', 'MTH 121: Functions, Limits, Differentiation & Integration', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Mathematics', '100 Level', '$\textrm{What}$ $\textrm{is}$ $\textrm{the}$ $\textrm{domain}$ $\textrm{of}$ $f(x) = 1/(x-3)?$', '["$\\textrm{R}$", "$\\textrm{R}$ $\\textrm{except}$ $\\textrm{x}$ $\\textrm{=}$ $\\textrm{3}$", "$x > 3$ $\\textrm{only}$", "$x < 3$ $\\textrm{only}$"]'::jsonb, 1, '$\textrm{For}$ $f(x) = \frac{1}{x - 3}$ $\textrm{to}$ $\textrm{be}$ $\textrm{defined,}$ $\textrm{the}$ $\textrm{denominator}$ $\textrm{must}$ $\textrm{not}$ $\textrm{be}$ $\textrm{zero:}$ $x - 3 \neq 0$$\textrm{,}$ $\textrm{which}$ $\textrm{excludes}$ $x = 3$$\textrm{.}$ $\textrm{Combining}$ $\textrm{these}$ $\textrm{conditions,}$ $\textrm{the}$ $\textrm{domain}$ $\textrm{is}$ $\left(-\infty, 3\right) \cup \left(3, \infty\right)$$\textrm{.}$', 'Real-valued Functions of a Real Variable', false),
