  ('mth-121-calculus', 'MTH 121: Functions, Limits, Differentiation & Integration', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Mathematics', '100 Level', '$\textrm{For}$ $f(x) = x^3 - 3x$$\textrm{,}$ $\textrm{use}$ $\textrm{the}$ $\textrm{first}$ $\textrm{derivative}$ $\textrm{test}$ $\textrm{to}$ $\textrm{determine}$ $\textrm{the}$ $\textrm{nature}$ $\textrm{of}$ $\textrm{the}$ $\textrm{critical}$ $\textrm{point}$ $\textrm{at}$ $\textrm{x}$ $\textrm{=}$ $\textrm{-1.}$', '["$\\textrm{relative}$ $\\textrm{maximum}$", "$\\textrm{relative}$ $\\textrm{minimum}$", "$\\textrm{point}$ $\\textrm{of}$ $\\textrm{inflection}$", "$\\textrm{not}$ $\\textrm{a}$ $\\textrm{critical}$ $\\textrm{point}$"]'::jsonb, 0, '$f''(x) = 3x^{2} - 3 = 3(x-1)(x+1)$$\textrm{,}$ $\textrm{so}$ $\textrm{the}$ $\textrm{critical}$ $\textrm{points}$ $\textrm{are}$ $x=-1$ $\textrm{and}$ $x=1$$\textrm{.}$ $\textrm{For}$ $x$ $\textrm{slightly}$ $\textrm{less}$ $\textrm{than}$ $-1$$\textrm{,}$ $f''(x) > 0$ $\textrm{(increasing);}$ $\textrm{for}$ $x$ $\textrm{slightly}$ $\textrm{greater}$ $\textrm{than}$ $-1$$\textrm{,}$ $f''(x) < 0$ $\textrm{(decreasing).}$ $\textrm{Since}$ $f''$ $\textrm{changes}$ $\textrm{from}$ $\textrm{positive}$ $\textrm{to}$ $\textrm{negative,}$ $x=-1$ $\textrm{is}$ $\textrm{a}$ $\textrm{relative}$ $\textrm{maximum.}$', 'Extrema of a Function', false),
